                                "sense_id": "44f7bdd2-0d7e-3096-aa4b-b3b61d4d2858",
                                "text": "The claim is meritless: The president retains the power to repatriate detainees to foreign countries, but Congress determines whether to fund prisoner transfers and who qualifies for entry into the U.S."
